<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Quality Control & GMP Compliance</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Protect your institutional reputation and regulatory status with an uncompromising 
            quality enforcement engine—engineered for WHO GMP and ISO 9001 standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Inspection Plan Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize your quality checkpoints across the entire production lifecycle. 
            Define detailed inspection plans for raw materials, in-process stages, 
            and finished goods. Operators and QC technicians capture test results—numeric 
            values, pass/fail indicators, and visual observations—directly into 
            the system. The software automatically enforces acceptable limits, 
            flagging any out-of-specification (OOS) results for immediate 
            technical review.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">GMP Staging & Certificate Generation</h2>
        <p>
            Secure your batch release process through digital stewardship. For pharmaceutical 
            (Pharmanova) operations, the system enforces chemical quarantine and WHO 
            GMP release workflows. Only after authorized Quality Assurance sign-off 
            can a batch be staged for dispatch. Finished goods are automatically 
            linked to a professional Certificate of Analysis (CoA), consolidating 
            all test results into a branded document required for regulatory and 
            commercial delivery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">NCR & CAPA Governance</h2>
        <p>
            Transform quality incidents into process improvements. Whenever a quality threshold 
            is missed, the system triggers a Non-Conformance Report (NCR) workflow, 
            managing the disposition (Scrap, Rework, Accept-as-is) with an immutable 
            audit trail. Integrated Corrective and Preventive Action (CAPA) tracking 
            ensures that the root causes of quality drifting are identified and 
            permanently mitigated, fostering a culture of continuous institutional 
            improvement.
        </p>
        <p>
            Detailed quality analytics identify trends in supplier performance and 
            machine reliability, informing the facility's overall risk management 
            strategy.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

